{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "central_D1_periodic",
    "description": "Second-order centered first derivative with periodic boundary on cartesian_uniform_1d. Interior [2, N-1]: the imported 3-point centered stencil (f[i+1]-f[i-1])/(2 dx). Faces wrap periodically: the i=1 face uses the ghost f[0]=f[N], giving (f[2]-f[N])/(2 dx); the i=N face uses f[N+1]=f[1], giving (f[1]-f[N-1])/(2 dx). `dx` is a free name resolving to the consuming model's spacing variable (the grid's consumer-supplied geometry contract; see grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/grid.esm) — the periodic wrap is dx-scale-invariant, so the rule serves any domain extent unchanged. Matches plain D(f, wrt: x) at default priority, so compound rules (e.g. a second-derivative rule at priority 10) fire first, match-scoped with `where: {f: {shape: [x]}}` (esm-spec §9.6.1) so it fires only on the first derivative of a bare field over this grid's `x` index set; under import-edge renaming (esm-spec §9.7.7) the wrt literal and the where shape follow the renamed axis together. O(dx^2). A model imports exactly one first-derivative rule for `x` (this centered rule or an upwind rule), never both.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:rule", "family:finite_difference", "grid:cartesian_uniform_1d", "op:D", "axes:x", "order:2", "stencil_width:3", "bc:periodic", "spec:9.6.8"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Fornberg, B. (1988). Generation of finite difference formulas on arbitrarily spaced grids. Mathematics of Computation 51(184), 699-706.",
        "doi": "10.1090/S0025-5718-1988-0935077-0"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "../stencils/central_D1_interior.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "central_D1_periodic": {
      "params": ["f"],
      "match": { "op": "D", "args": ["f"], "wrt": "x" },
      "where": { "f": { "shape": ["x"] } },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[2, { "op": "-", "args": ["N", 1] }]],
          [[1, 1]],
          [["N", "N"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "central_D1_interior",
            "bindings": { "f": "f" }
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "index", "args": ["f", 2] },
                  { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "N"] }
                ]
              },
              { "op": "*", "args": [2, "dx"] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "index", "args": ["f", 1] },
                  { "op": "index", "args": ["f", { "op": "-", "args": ["N", 1] }] }
                ]
              },
              { "op": "*", "args": [2, "dx"] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
